# Secrets never enter the repo. The RAW ARCHIVE is deliberately tracked:
# workflow runs commit their own results, making provenance durable.
#
# The STORE (data/parl-monitor.db) is different as of 2026-08-24: it reached
# 92MB against GitHub's 100MB hard push limit, growing ~15MB per build
# sprint, so it moved to a GitHub Release asset (tools/db_state.py). Its
# provenance lives on as the committed data/parl-monitor.db.json sidecar
# (size + sha256 + producing run), which is why that file must NEVER be
# ignored. The ignore line for the db itself is added only once the first
# asset is published -- untracking it earlier would leave a workflow with
# no store at all.
config/secrets.yaml
data/pull-logs/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
partner_site/.vercel/
partner_site/.env.local
.vercel
.env*
# Google service account key: never commit
config/google-service-account.json
